※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4216 LANG_TYPE_ROTATE_IS_UNSIGNED

※ Turning bits round says nothing about a number that has a sign: the bit that
※ would come round into the top is the one that says which sign it has.
let value: i8 = 13i8
let one: i8 = 1i8

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    @[ignore(5005)]
    value ↺ one
    0u8
